===Meet up with Dan Heng at Synwood Pavilion{{subst:void|<!--202060102-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Exalting Sanctum|update|The wanderer, once meant to be permanently exiled, has returned to the Luofu. Dan Heng, determined to face his past, has invited you to join him in meeting the high elder of the Vidyadhara.<br />You never expected "Cold Dragon Young" to talk much about his own affairs, so this might be a rare chance. Finish this homecoming adventure and show off what you reaped to March 7th after.}}
