===Speak with Huanxi and head to the Scalegorge Waterscape{{subst:void|<!--202060115-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Alchemy Commission|update|After dealing with those arrogant assassins, Dan Heng decides to ignore the Vidyadhara Preceptors' invitation and head to Scalegorge Waterscape directly with the messenger to meet the young high elder.<br />You don't know many Vidyadhara, so you're not sure whether it's normal for so many people to care about the whereabouts of the high elder. Dan Heng's presence is like a rock striking ripples across the water.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:'''Dan Heng:''' Now that the seal is repaired, my affairs on the Xianzhou have drawn to an end... for the time being.
:'''Jing Yuan:''' Are you planning on staying on the Luofu? The banishment decree has been revoked, and the Preceptors have regained an awareness of the situation. This is your chance to return to your homeland.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Dan Heng belongs to the Astral Express...
::'''Jing Yuan:''' Hahahaha, I do not seek to take Dan Heng away from you.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You should stay... but remember to write to us.
::'''Jing Yuan:''' You're... asking him to stay here?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} (Wait for Dan Heng's response)
::'''Dan Heng:''' As a Nameless, the Express still needs me.
::'''Jing Yuan:''' Ah... that is a pity.
::----

